How may I help you?

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.750
Hi, my name is Alex Blackwell.

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:17.050
I was just wondering...

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:20.160
How much would you pay for a picture of a real werewolf?

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:41.340
What are you doing out here?

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:42.520
Hannah told me what happened.

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:44.760
She said you were coming back out here again tonight.

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:47.430
I couldn't let you face the werewolves alone.

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:49.360
You believe in the werewolves?

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:50.760
Of course I do, Alex.

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:52.060
I have to.

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:52.780
