00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:03.240
No more chocolate bars before bed.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:07.700
No picture, no money, no cover, nothing.

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:11.330
Oh no!

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:13.820
Is it Florida?

00:07:14.980 --> 00:07:16.040
Uncle Colin?

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:30.830
Thank you.

00:08:14.230 --> 00:08:14.690
something

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:01.650
Alex.

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:05.780
Must have been a cat or something.

00:09:08.220 --> 00:09:08.700
Or something.

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:31.780
Morning, Alex. Finch toast.

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:34.160
Um.

